<title>UK: Biocompatibles up to peak on followthrough.</title>
<headline>Biocompatibles up to peak on followthrough.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Biocompatibles International climbed to a fresh record peak on Monday, extending last week's rally ingited by a brokerage recommendation, dealers said.</p>
<p>By 0850 GMT, the shares were up 27-1/2p to 730p.</p>
<p>Shares in Biocompatibles surged on Friday after Kleinwort Benson rated the stock a &quot;buy&quot; in a research report.</p>
<p>--Debra Sherman, London newsroom +44 171 542 4026</p>
